# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Generated test harnesses. These are throwaway copies of index.html used to
# force the reduced-motion / iOS-fallback / no-IntersectionObserver code paths
# during testing (see README "Testing the alternate paths"). They should never
# be committed or deployed — a stray one on a live host is a public duplicate
# of the site with its capability detection disabled.
_*-test.html
_*-test.css

# Video derivatives and the 4K source master ARE committed on purpose — the
# static deploy serves them straight from the repo. Note that git stores every
# version of a binary forever, so a re-encode adds another full copy to history
# rather than a diff. If the videos are ever re-cut more than once or twice,
# move them to Git LFS or to the host's asset storage before that history
# becomes painful.
